; Example usage of the `pair-b` plugin standalone. `pair-a`'s
; `(palette …)` form is the cross-plugin consumer, but these forms
; are also valid on their own, which is useful for testing the per-plugin
; schema in isolation.

(color :hex "#1f2937" :name slate)
(gradient :from "#9333ea" :to "#06b6d4" :angle 45)
